  "snippet": "Cloudy\n\n26°\n\n21° 4\n\nRain becoming steadier\n\n26°\n\n21°\n\n## Temperature Graph\n\n°C\n\nAvg. Hi\n\nAvg. Lo\n\nActual Hi\n\nActual Lo\n\nForecast Hi\n\nForecast Lo\n\n## June Weather in Tokyo\n\nTokyo's June 2026 forecast shows daily high temperatures ranging from 23.2° to 30.8°, with overnight lows between 17.7° and 21.8°. The average high for June is 26° with an average low of 20°. AccuWeather's monthly forecast extends further ahead than any other source, with day-by-day RealFeel® Temperatures giving a complete picture of how June weather will actually feel in Tokyo. See also: July | August | September.\n\nFurther Ahead\n\n### July 2026 ### August 2026\n\nAround the Globe\n\n### Hurricane Tracker ### Severe Weather ### Radar & Maps ### News ### Video\n\nTop Stories\n\nWeather Forecasts [...] ### Video\n\nToday   Hourly   10-Day   Radar   MinuteCast®  ## Monthly  Air Quality   Health & Activities\n\n## June\n\nJanuary   February   March   April   May   June   July   August   September   October   November   December\n\n## 2026\n\n2025   2026   2027\n\n## 10-Day\n\nS\n\nM\n\nT\n\nW\n\nT\n\nF\n\nS\n\n31\n\nWarm; breezy in the afternoon\n\n31°\n\n20° 1\n\nWarm; breezy in the afternoon\n\n31°\n\n20° 2\n\nSun through high clouds\n\n29°\n\n21° 3\n\nMorning rain; cloudy, humid\n\n27°\n\n21° 4\n\nA morning shower; cloudy\n\n28°\n\n21° 5\n\nSun and clouds\n\n29°\n\n20° 6\n\nPartly sunny\n\n26°\n\n19° 7\n\nA little afternoon rain\n\n26°\n\n19° 8\n\nA little morning rain\n\n27°\n\n19° 9\n\nSunshine and a few clouds\n\n23°\n\n18° 10\n\nCloudy, a little rain; humid\n\n24°\n\n20° 11\n\nHumid with rain\n\n25°\n\n20° 12\n\nHumid with sunny intervals\n\n24°\n\n20° 13\n\nA bit of rain in the morning"
